  (text "Regulated 5.1V / 2A input. LCD: GND, 5V, SDA, SCL (0x27). Keypad expander: 0x20.\nRC522 is 3.3V only; its SDA pin is SPI chip-select. R503 uses its supplied MX1 harness.\nSpeaker connects between SPK_P and SPK_N; neither output is ground.\nEvery functional connection is drawn as a continuous wire. Dots mark joins; plain crossings do not connect." (at 20.32 396.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "c3b496bd-e02b-43e0-8586-e7a4c7404184"))
)
